<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Awande buys 90 pct of Tsongoari.</title>
<headline>Awande buys 90 pct of Tsongoari.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Awande Holdings Ltd, formerly Afmin Holdings Ltd, announced on Monday it had acquired a 90 percent interest in Tsongoari Exploration Ltd from Rand Mines Windhoek Exploration Ltd for two million rand.</p>
<p>The purchase price would be settled by the transfer of Awande's investment in 38,000 Durban Roodepoort Deep Ltd at 4,114 cents each and 436,680 rand cash.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
